{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"8431","name":"Le Jardin Resort","description":"Le Jardin Resort, which operates with an Ultra All Inclusive concept, welcomes guests in the Kiriş area of Kemer, one of Antalya’s most popular holiday destinations. The property is located directly by the sea and features its own private beach. Sunbeds and umbrellas on the beach are provided free of charge for guests. The spacious and comfortable rooms of the resort include a balcony, minibar, LCD TV, satellite broadcast, air conditioning, and a safety deposit box. A 24-hour front desk, luggage storage, laundry, and dry-cleaning services are also available to guests. Le Jardin Resort is located 7 km from the center of Kemer. The Tulip Bar and Lobby Bar areas have been completely renovated, and the indoor playground of the mini club has been expanded. The tables and chairs in the main restaurant have also been renewed.","address":"Sahil Cad. Kiris Mevkii, 7","city":"KEMER - ANTALYA","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"7980","lat":36.5704623,"lng":30.5766388,"stars":5,"chain":"QPRHT","giataCode":"5766","phone":"+902428245222","email":"info@qprhotels.com","website":"www.qprhotels.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/008431/008431a_hb_a_909.JPG","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/008431/008431a_hb_a_908.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/008431/008431a_hb_a_911_20251115_103338.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/008431/008431a_hb_a_912_20251115_103344.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/008431/008431a_hb_a_913_20251115_103345.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/008431/008431a_hb_a_914_20251115_103346.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger